    <trigger>If B02 ArchTest surfaces `AddOptions<T>.ValidateOnStart()` sites with NO manifest entry, document each as new punch-list rows + include in wrap-up notes. Do NOT silently amend manifest without owner review — the drift itself is the surfaced defect.</trigger>
